msgctxt "80"
msgid "Well? Had enough?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Shit! I'm sorry, man! We'll get outta your hair! No harm,\r\n"
"no foul... yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I don't remember saying you could leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Eep! Please don't kick our asses anymore, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"You really don't know how to talk to your elders, huh?\r\n"
"Am I gonna have to beat some more manners into you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Wait, no! No more beating, please! Anything but more beating!\r\n"
"Just, please. Let us go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Hmph. Maybe next time you'll remember your place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Yeah, of course! I'm goin' on the straight and narrow! Promise!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "...Fine. Get out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Oh thank god! I mean... thank god, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "C'mon boys, let's leg it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Kids these days. You all right, Haruka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Mhm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Good. Now let's go see your Uncle Kazuki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "This is where Uncle Kazuki is, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Yup. Something up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Well, I was just thinking... Can we go have some fun after we\r\n"
"see him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Heh. Of course, Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Just a sec there, buddy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"This town's no place to be bringin' a little girl, old man.\r\n"
"You get lost on your way to the fun fair?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "None of your business. Now back off, or I'll make you back off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Ooooh! I'm sooo scared!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Dude, what's with this asshole? Guy's pissing me off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Sure, pal. We'll back off... if you hand over some cash.\r\n"
"I mean, that girl of yours gets an allowance, yeah? How\r\n"
"'bout sharing the wealth?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Sorry, not happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Just fork it over, man! You don't wanna get your ass beat\r\n"
"in front of your kid, do ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "You even listening, you old fuck!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Look. If you get lost now, I'll forget this ever happened.\r\n"
"But if you stick around... you're gonna pay. Promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "You think you can take us, asshole!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"You're the only one who's gonna be payin' today, man.\r\n"
"Either in cash, or in blood. Your choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"I'll get you some blood if you want... but it's not gonna be\r\n"
"mine, if you catch me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Ha, good one! You're gonna regret this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "We'll see about that. Let's go."
msgstr ""

